        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Unused.  This is Zinnia’s Key Stone in Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire, but it cannot be obtained by the player.",
      "short_effect": "Unused NPC Key Stone.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "メガストーンを　もったまま　たたかう\nポケモンを　メガシンカさせる\nみちのパワーを　ひめた　アンクレット。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "메가스톤을 지닌 채로 싸우는\n포켓몬을 메가진화시키는\n미지의 힘을 가진 앵클릿.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "隱藏著未知力量的腳鐲。\n能讓攜帶著超級石戰鬥的\n寶可夢進行超級進化。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une grève aux pouvoirs mystérieux permettant à\nun Pokémon de méga-évoluer au combat s’il tient\nla bonne Méga-Gemme.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Beinreif mit geheimnisvollen Kräften.\nEr ermöglicht Pokémon, die einen Mega-Stein\ntragen, eine Mega-Entwicklung durchzuführen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tobillera con un poder misterioso que permite\nmegaevolucionar a Pokémon que lleven la\nMegapiedra adecuada.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cavigliera dotata di un misterioso potere.\nPermette a un Pokémon che ha una Megapietra\ndi megaevolversi durante la lotta.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This anklet contains an untold power that somehow\nenables Pokémon carrying a Mega Stone to\nMega Evolve in battle.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "メガストーンを　持ったまま　戦う\nポケモンを　メガシンカさせる\n未知のパワーを　秘めた　アンクレット。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "蕴藏着未知力量的脚镯。\n能让携带着超级石战斗的\n宝可梦进行超级进化。",
